SUMMARY:This Week In the Lab: Breakerspace
DESCRIPTION:Join the Maker   STEAM Team in the Innovation Lab during 
 specified open hours to tinker with used and broken electronics through 
 taking items apart! We'll provide the tools\, you provide the 
 curiosity!\n\nThis is a self-paced activity. You can drop in during the 
 listed Open Lab Hours.\n\nInnovation Lab Open Hours:\n\nMonday: 
 Closed\nTuesday: 1pm - 5pm\nWednesday: 3pm - 5pm (*different this 
 week)\nThursday: 10am - 2pm\nFriday: 1pm - 5pm\nSaturday: 11am - 1pm and 
 3pm - 5pm\n\nHours subject to change based on staffing and programming 
 needs.
LOCATION:Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Caroline Flory":MAILTO:cflory@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Arts & Crafts, Maker, STEAM
UID:LibCal-14288-16708605
