SUMMARY:Cemetery Stories: Discoveries From The Friends of Geer Cemetery
DESCRIPTION:Come to Stanford L. Warren Library for a presentation by The 
 Friends Of Geer Cemetery about the work restoring the historic Geer Street 
 Cemetery\, one of Durham’s first burial grounds for the African American 
