SUMMARY:Durham Book Club
DESCRIPTION:The Durham Book Club reading season is April - July\, one book 
 per month. You can learn more about the books on the flyer. Author visits 
 are happening\, book activity planning is underway and a primo 2026 T-shirt 
 awaits! All free for the best readers in the world!\n\nOur summer program\, 
 DBCreads\, is part of a larger initiative of Durham Book Club- our other 
 branches include DBCwrites (we have a blog!) and DBCtalks (we have a 
 podcast!). Durham Book Club is supported by our parent organization\, 
 StrongHERTogetHER.\n\nLearn more about Durham Book Club here: 
