SUMMARY:Summer Learning Bag Giveaway
DESCRIPTION:Join us in the Main Library's Children Programming Room every 
 Tuesday in July (while supplies last) for a special program dedicated to 
 supporting elementary students and their families all summer long. Thanks 
 to a generous grant from the Durham Library Foundation\, the Durham County 
 Library will be distributing Summer Learning Bags designed to help students 
 in grades K-5 avoid the “summer slide\,” a time when many children lose 
 progress in reading and math skills.\n\nEach Summer Learning Bag is 
 thoughtfully assembled and filled with fun\, engaging materials including 
 hands-on activities\, math games\, sensory items\, school supplies\, and 
