SUMMARY:Homeschool Learning Lab: Tie Dye Party
DESCRIPTION:\nJoin us for our annual tie-dye day! Bring a white shirt\, 
 socks\, or any item you’d like to dye. This program will be held on 
 Thursday\, August 6\, 2026\, at 10a.m at North Regional Library on the 
 patio\, weather permitting. The address is 221 Milton Rd. Durham\, NC 
 27712. \n\n\n\nHomeschool Learning Lab meets every Thursday with fun 
 enrichment activities for our homeschool community. Best suited for 
 elementary ages\, but everyone is welcome! \n\n\nIf you have any 
 questions\, accessibility questions or accommodation needs\, please contact 
 Molly at mschaefer@dconc.gov.  We ask that all requests be made at least 
 three (3) business days prior to the event to ensure we can provide the 
 best accommodations possible!
