SUMMARY:Small and Steady: How to Build Habits That Hold During the Hard Times
DESCRIPTION:Most habit advice was written for people who aren't exhausted\, 
 in pain\, or managing a health challenge. This workshop takes a different 
 approach. We'll look at why so many good habits fall apart during hard 
 times\, what makes a habit actually sustainable\, and how to build a small 
 daily practice around movement\, sleep\, eating\, or stress that doesn't 
 require you to feel good first.
LOCATION:Meeting Room #4347\, Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Alexandra Wurst":MAILTO:awurst@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Business, Career Development, Other, Social
