SUMMARY:Preschool STEAM Storytime: Let's Learn About Spiders!
DESCRIPTION:Preschoolers (ages 3-5 years) and their caregivers are welcome 
 to join Ms. Natalie for a STEAM (Science\, Technology\, Engineering\, 
 Arts\, and Mathematics) storytime! On the 1st and 3rd Monday of every 
 month\, we will explore a different STEAM topic with stories\, songs\, and 
 a hands-on activity.\n\nThis week\, we will learn all about spiders and 
 create our own spiderweb shapes using Crayola Model Magic clay and paper 
 plates!\n\nRegistration is required.\n\nIf you have any questions\, please 
 contact us @ 919-560-8592.
LOCATION:Southwest Regional - Children's Programming Room\, Southwest Regional Library (3605 Shannon Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Natalie Perez":MAILTO:natperez@dconc.gov
