SUMMARY:Dungeon Crafter Carl: A Cricut Tutorial
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to use a Cricut cutting machine and Cricut heat press 
 in this Dungeon Crawler Carl-themed tutorial! We will use the Cricut to 
 create a decal\, then affix it to a library-provided pouch using the heat 
 press. You are welcome to bring your own plain t shirt or bag to use 
 instead of the pouch if you prefer. \n\n \n\nThank you to InkAndEpicPress 
 for generously donating the Dungeon Crawler Carl designs for this 
 program!\n\n \n\nWhen signing up for the program\, please select which 
 design you'd like:\n\n\n	Option A: heart boxers\, Princess Donut\, 
 Mongo\n\n\n\n\n\n	Option B: Katia\, Prepotente\, Samantha\n\n\n\n\nYou will 
 also need to select what color you'd like your design to be. The entire 
 design will be a single color\, like in the images above.
