SUMMARY:Tomato Plant Cuttings Giveaway
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we give away cuttings from our tomato plants!\n\nAt 
 Bragtown we have enormous tomato plants that we have taken cuttings from to 
 give to anyone who wants fresh tomatoes at home. These plants will have 
 roots\, so you can feel free to place them in a pot at home.\n\nIf we run 
