SUMMARY:STEAM Big: Dinosaur Excavation Dig
DESCRIPTION:Dig up a dinosaur figure in each Dino Excavation Kit! Find a 
 mystery dino figure inside---either Pachycephalosaurus\, Stegosaurus\, 
 Dimetrodon\, Ankylosaurus\, or T.rex! These dig kits are the perfect way to 
 explore the fascinating world of dinosaurs!\n\nAll supplies 
 provided.\n\nRegistration opens July 22.
