SUMMARY:Triangle Comics Creator Network
DESCRIPTION:Tons of comics writers and artists make their homes in Durham\, 
 Chapel Hill\, Raleigh\, Hillsborough\, Cary and nearby\, but too many of us 
 think we're alone. Well\, not anymore!  Join the Triangle Comics Creator 
 Network and get to know fellow creators of all backgrounds\, working in all 
 genres\, at all skill levels.  Friends and family welcome too.\n\nThis 
 month we will be sharing our first comics! For this show-and-tell\, bring 
 your first comics\, zines\, fan art\, drawings\, or whatever to share! 
 \n\nHope to see you there!\n\nWe will be meeting at Atomic Empire\, located 
 at the following address:\n\n3400 Westgate Dr #14b\n\nDurham\, NC 
 27707\n\nHave questions? Want to hear more about the anthology? Feel free 
 to call Mara (she/her/hers) at 919-560-0207 or email her at 
 mplantholt@dconc.gov.
LOCATION:Offsite
ORGANIZER;CN="Mara Plantholt":MAILTO:mplantholt@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Arts & Crafts, Writing
UID:LibCal-14288-17020599
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/17020599
END:VEVENT
