SUMMARY:Transformers One & Toy Time!!
DESCRIPTION:Come beat the summer heat with a special screening of the 2023 
 animated hit Transformers One! See how young Optimus Prime and Megatron 
 "transform" into their true selves. This screening will feature lots of toy 
 cars\, Legos\, Play-Doh\, and of course\, plenty of snacks. Join us in the 
 children's programming room at 2:00! \n\n \n\nRated PG for sci-fi violence 
 & animated action
