SUMMARY:Song Circle Symposium
DESCRIPTION:\n\n🎶 Song Circle Symposium at the Library\n\nDiscover the 
 Power of Community Singing\n\nJoin us for a special Song Circle Symposium\, 
 where we dive into the world of song circles. \n\nWhat to 
 Expect:\n\n\n	Panel discussion with local facilitators and 
 participants\n	Interactive Q&A on joining a circle\n	Resources to support 
 community singing in your area\n	Live demonstrations of how a song circle 
 flows\n\n\nWhy Attend?\n\n\n	Learn how song circles foster community and 
 mental wellness\n	Discover songs that are easy and fun to sing 
 together\n	Get inspired to bring a song circle to your neighborhood\n\n\nNo 
 musical experience is needed.
LOCATION:Southwest Meeting Room\, Southwest Regional Library (3605 Shannon Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Jason Howard":MAILTO:jchoward@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Durham
