SUMMARY:Fragrance Club & Swap
DESCRIPTION:This monthly program is a space for fragrance enthusiasts to 
 meet and share all things fragrance! Whether you are new to fragrance or an 
 experienced hobbyist\, this program will help you discover new perfumes and 
 scents. Bring perfumes\, candles\, or essential oils to share and discuss 
 as we learn about the art of olfaction!\n\n \n\nRegistration is 
 encouraged\, but not required.
